+// gate's, so the two lock chains never share a counter, and every lock ends the kernel reset to
+// zero as before. The epilogue applies act_mul_h2 (the per-element math of act_mul_kernel_h)
+// once both outputs are final
+template<EXL3_GEMM_T_ARGS>
